      "notes": "Regional zonal list, not a demonstrated co-occurrence of every taxon in every listed core. Reference interval is borehole 24 с – Ренів, 432–563 м, thickness 131 м. Deposits are described generally as carbonate–terrigenous, without an explicit depositional environment for this assemblage. Reworking is not discussed. The prose reports Emphanisporites minutus, whereas the qualitative list and Table 1 place E. minutus after Emphanizonosporites salantaicus; both source forms are retained and may duplicate one intended taxon. Anreticulispora plicata and Apiculiretusispora plicata are likewise both reported. Speciososporites novus, Leiotriletes laevis and L. simplex occur in the prose but are omitted from Table 1.",
